  "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nNot sure if we do any math on the output from TrueNAS:\n\n- I only have 64gb of ram\n- Homarr states I have 74gb~ of ram\n- Unsure if used ram number is correct either (unverified)\n\n<img width=\"159\" height=\"163\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/065caf6a-f97f-4e4f-9cda-45e3d52e3cf3\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Install Homarr 1.51.0 via Docker Compose\n- Add truenas integration (TrueNAS 25.04)\n- Add system resources widget with cpu and ram only\n- Mouseover new widget's ram section\n\n### Impact\n\nLow, visual, but incorrect info\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_\n\n### Version\n\n1.51.0 (you have to update your issues template! it only goes up to 1.49.0)\n\n### Installation method\n\nDocker Run\n\n### Browser\n\nChrome",
